{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0494_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bb7ee0c0bae838d249590e1ceb600d126478eb869f000cf68809e0d78a7bed29", "ja": "（今日は定期公演。のり子のパートが終わると、\n割れんばかりの歓声が上がった！）", "zh": "（今天是定期公演。法子的部分结束后，现场响起了震耳欲聋的欢呼声！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0494_1001_audience", "source_sha256": "156b437d3a6431e05cddd3e0b1e073bbff15fbffc98871151515d6a698349ba5", "ja": "ワアアアアーーッ……！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊——……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0494_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "ac111c5ad6564856840504f511b45c98c862825f01e7064a744dc5b88add4e71", "ja": "たくさん応援してくれて、ありがとうー！\nアタシの色がいっぱいで……本当に嬉しかったよー！", "zh": "谢谢大家一直为我加油——！\n满眼都是我的颜色……我真的好开心——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0494_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "7e2bad4275a9270d1607daacad401f552a2e8a3c2580955dded61bf9a15413f7", "ja": "この後も、まだまだすごい曲が残ってるから。\nみんな、最後まで楽しんでいってね～！", "zh": "接下来还有很多精彩的歌曲。\n大家要一直享受到最后哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0494_1004_audience", "source_sha256": "156b437d3a6431e05cddd3e0b1e073bbff15fbffc98871151515d6a698349ba5", "ja": "ワアアアアーーッ……！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊——……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0494_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "c0660b193530b3a63f7339a00db4428d33ace98fbdbe74b77ed39e4e50a75559", "ja": "ふぅ……楽しかったー！\nなんか、すごいやりきったー！　って感じ！", "zh": "呼……好开心啊！\n总觉得，有种特别痛快地完成了一件大事的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0494_1006_p", "source_sha256": "47234efab023e6afce2641249026d66679f77b5f3ce7fd49f4d85ce4d4aa93b7", "ja": "お疲れさま、のり子。\n見てるこっちまで、熱気が伝わってきたよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，法子。\n连我这个在旁边看的人，都感受到你的热情了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0494_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "faaace6abab67c1235c1d96cdb1a1e7efe691720f088192584f212f680621727", "ja": "えへへ、よかった♪\nじゃあ……もしかして、なんだけど、さ。", "zh": "嘿嘿，太好了♪\n那么……虽然可能有点冒昧，我想问一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0494_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "4818f88be047c4e2a7bfad70997e7916f318bd91ad53054a268c5226b9c395f4", "ja": "アタシが感動して、その……ちょっと、\n涙ぐんじゃってたのも……バレてたりするのかな？", "zh": "我被感动得……那个，有点眼泪汪汪的样子……是不是也被发现了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0494_1009_p", "source_sha256": "58f98c90e514a0cf3165337ed9ed5291631748e122f7b67ff8c6dd2bddfd133c", "ja": "多分……。", "zh": "大概吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0494_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "e811394e90e78b7266c3e45de60438ddebf6a8b2b2cec0c0cff26880ab31feab", "ja": "や、やっぱり！！？\n今回は大丈夫って思ってたのに～！　ううっ。", "zh": "果、果然是吗！！？\n我还以为这次不要紧的呢～！呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0494_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "ae6fb951cdc4d9576c13382168b31490ac45c1e21abc2f3da70b352ec0f5b596", "ja": "コンサートライトでいっぱいの客席を見ちゃうと、\nダメなんだよねぇ……。グッとくるっていうか……。", "zh": "一看到满是演唱会荧光棒的观众席，我就受不了了……总觉得特别感动……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0494_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "f4654f55701875c424893bc3c5c0e8f79102dbd10b9ae1aae65d8fa2ef4ca2c1", "ja": "プロレスで熱い試合を観た直後の感動……\nとは、ちょっと違うかも？　うーん……？", "zh": "或许和刚看完职业摔角的精彩比赛时那种感动……有点不一样？嗯……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0494_1013_p", "source_sha256": "3839d96ff7ddac186ec20a650f399cbc0b906c75ff8292edb7e67b654414d5d2", "ja": "ははっ。それは、のり子が当事者だからかもな。\nほら、レスラーの立場だと感じ方も違うだろ？", "zh": "哈哈。那可能是因为你亲身参与其中吧，海苔子。\n毕竟站在摔跤手的立场上，感受也会不一样，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0494_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "6ef95f2af881061c12351d9eea2b96916e0818cb5fe637bd9acf371d3fe9a516", "ja": "あ……そっか。\nなんか、すごいしっくりきたかも。", "zh": "啊……这样啊。\n总觉得，好像一下子就想通了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0494_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "f6f7c31c90458ae44285953acbf3397ae1a51eef9535146c882e252e84304879", "ja": "ステージでのアタシは、\nお客さんを楽しませるレスラーも同然……！", "zh": "在舞台上的我，就和让观众开心的摔跤手没什么两样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0494_1016_p", "source_sha256": "55ff1d6d3333da6842c0184f63ac5b529c8303c4fc40607d05da07ae765a03af", "ja": "……同じような立場と言いたいだけで、\nのり子はレスラーじゃないからな？", "zh": "……我只是想说你们的立场差不多，\n但你可不是摔跤手啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0494_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "f8e68f805b447de84be381b25d04186b5dc54701cb7e67ab4d1d413002e177f4", "ja": "わかってるって。でも、舞台に立つ時の気持ちは、\nきっと、アイドルも選手も同じだと思うんだ。", "zh": "我知道啦。不过，登上舞台时的心情，\n偶像和选手肯定都是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0494_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "b66220bf13cc9bf43dcefd37e7eff3862309a49c2e314572d6f2f8549669d47f", "ja": "ここに立つからには、みんなに\n喜んでもらえるように全力を尽くすって。", "zh": "既然站在这里，就要竭尽全力，让大家都开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0494_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a64f0803f18826b43fc7d1219fa268240cf8b316f84160664a4169934a3c782f", "ja": "ああ。のり子が最高の試合……じゃなくて、\nステージができるように。俺も一緒に頑張るよ。", "zh": "啊。为了让法子能完成最棒的比赛……不对，是舞台。\n我也会一起努力的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0494_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "cbee601df5d64210e05a24fcc771279d4f89868cbb83f005804aa77d115f898b", "ja": "うん。頼りにしてるよ、{$P$}♪\n目指せ、生涯現役のトップアイドル！　……なんて。", "zh": "嗯，我就靠你了，{$P$}♪  \n目标是成为终身活跃的顶尖偶像！……开玩笑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
